<div style="background-color: #ffffff; color: #111827; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, sans-serif; padding: 2.5rem 1rem;">

